# Presentation

## Server Actions (`"use server"`)

- Live in `modules/<m>/presentation/actions/*.actions.ts`.
- Action state types in separate `types.ts` (no `"use server"`) for Client Components.
- Auth: `requireAuth` / `requireRole` from auth application guards.
- Validate with Zod; call use cases; `revalidatePath` when mutating UI data.

## Client Components (`"use client"`)

```tsx
// ❌ pulls server-only code into client bundle
import { createUserAction, type UserActionState } from "@/modules/users";

// ✅
import { createUserAction } from "@/modules/users/presentation/actions/user.actions";
import type { UserActionState } from "@/modules/users/presentation/actions/types";
```

## UI

Reuse `src/common/components/ui/*` and layouts in `common/components/layouts/`.
Env: `getEnv()` is server-only — never import in client.
